# developer-hub-env — Project Overview

Red Hat Developer Hub (RHDH) deployed on OpenShift using GitOps.
Ansible bootstraps OpenShift GitOps; ArgoCD then owns everything via App of Apps.

Owner: Red Hat employee (Etienne Dubois). Clusters are ephemeral RHDP (opentlc) sandboxes.

## Bootstrap Flow

```
1. Ansible bootstrap.yml
   └── Installs OpenShift GitOps operator (Subscription CR)
       └── Operator auto-creates default ArgoCD in openshift-gitops namespace
   └── Pre-creates Sealed Secrets signing key (shared with devops-ai-agentic)
   └── Applies the App-of-Apps ArgoCD Application CR

3. ArgoCD (owns everything from here)
   ├── Wave 1 — Sealed Secrets        (Bitnami Helm chart)
   ├── Wave 2 — Developer Hub Operator (Subscription + OperatorGroup CRs)
   └── Wave 3 — Developer Hub Instance (Backstage CR + app-config + plugins)
```

## Install Method per Component

| Component | Method |
|-----------|--------|
| OpenShift GitOps (ArgoCD) | Ansible `Subscription` CR → operator auto-creates default ArgoCD |
| Sealed Secrets | ArgoCD `Application` → Bitnami Helm chart (external repo) |
| Developer Hub Operator | ArgoCD `Application` → `Subscription` + `OperatorGroup` CRs |
| Developer Hub Instance | ArgoCD `Application` → `Backstage` CR + ConfigMaps |

## Repository Layout

```
ansible/           # Bootstrap only — Ansible bootstraps, ArgoCD owns ongoing state
  playbooks/bootstrap.yml
  inventory/group_vars/all/
    all.yml        # Non-sensitive defaults
    vault.yml      # Ansible Vault encrypted (sealed secrets key)
k8s/
  argocd/          # Root ArgoCD Application (app-of-apps)
  apps/            # Child ArgoCD Applications (one per component)
  developer-hub/
    operator/      # Operator namespace + OperatorGroup + Subscription
    instance/      # Backstage CR + app-config ConfigMaps + SealedSecrets
```

## Key Tools

- Ansible + `kubernetes.core` collection
- `kubeseal` CLI (SealedSecrets)
- `oc` CLI (OpenShift client)
- OpenShift 4.x (RHDP sandbox)
- RHDH operator — channel `fast`
- OpenShift GitOps (ArgoCD) — default instance in `openshift-gitops` namespace
